 r←isNewest PrepareHtmlPageForMajorVersionList_ row;id;major;noOfReleases
⍝ Returns one row of the list of major versions; see `PrepareHtmlPageForMajorVersionList`.
⍝ `isNewest` is 1 for the newest major version, which then says so.
 (id major noOfReleases)←row
 r←'<div class="major-row"><a href="',Reg.VersionOf_REST,'/packages/versions/',id,'-',major,'">Major version ',major,'</a>'
 r,←'<span>',(⍕noOfReleases),' release',((1≠noOfReleases)/'s'),(isNewest/' · <span class="latest">latest</span>'),'</span></div>'
⍝Done
